{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——自从把安洁接回家住。", "text_idx": 263, "plain": "——自从把安洁接回家住。", "plain_idx": 263, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "生活发生了许多变化，比如早上她叫我起床，一起去上学……", "text_idx": 264, "plain": "生活发生了许多变化，比如早上她叫我起床，一起去上学……", "plain_idx": 264, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "接下来要说的，估计就是对我影响最大的事。", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0961", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在是上学前的一点时间。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁不在，现在餐厅只有我和樱乃两个人。", "text_idx": 270, "plain": "安洁不在，现在餐厅只有我和樱乃两个人。", "plain_idx": 270, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……哥？」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0962", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，怎么了？」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为安洁的到来——\\n樱乃开始不叫我“哥哥”了，只叫我一声“哥”。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": "因为安洁的到来——樱乃开始不叫我“哥哥”了，只叫我一声“哥”。", "plain_idx": 275, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过我也不会指出来，免得尴尬。", "text_idx": 276, "plain": "不过我也不会指出来，免得尴尬。", "plain_idx": 276, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃的话，让我感觉到了她的想法，我不由得挺直了腰杆。", "text_idx": 277, "plain": "樱乃的话，让我感觉到了她的想法，我不由得挺直了腰杆。", "plain_idx": 277, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我感到自己已经不再仅仅是“樱乃的哥哥”，而更像是“安洁的少爷”……", "text_idx": 278, "plain": "我感到自己已经不再仅仅是“樱乃的哥哥”，而更像是“安洁的少爷”……", "plain_idx": 278, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，抱歉，我有些走神了」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「意淫呢？」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0963", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
