{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总之，樱乃似乎很积极地接受了周围的变化，我觉得很感激。", "text_idx": 285, "plain": "总之，樱乃似乎很积极地接受了周围的变化，我觉得很感激。", "plain_idx": 285, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
