{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的脸热了起来。", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃就算了，连父母也这么……", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……看来我也得给他们打个电话」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥害羞了，这下有的瞧了」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0970", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃欣喜地说着，喝掉了杯子里剩下的茶。", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我再次深切地感受到，能有今天多亏了身边的朋友们。", "text_idx": 307, "plain": "我再次深切地感受到，能有今天多亏了身边的朋友们。", "plain_idx": 307, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈哈哈，红包啊……」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag1899", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我很期待和老爷还有太太他们的见面……」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": "「我很期待和老爷还有太太他们的见面……」", "plain_idx": 311, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag1900", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我想他们也很好奇」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我晚上想给他们打个电话，难得的机会，安洁你要不也说两句？」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": "「我晚上想给他们打个电话，难得的机会，安洁你要不也说两句？」", "plain_idx": 314, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好的！我一定要感谢他们」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": "「好的！我一定要感谢他们」", "plain_idx": 315, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag1901", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……感觉脊背都挺直了，少爷」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag1902", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，是吗？？」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag1903", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我的确感受到了来自朋友们深切的关怀」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": "「我的确感受到了来自朋友们深切的关怀」", "plain_idx": 322, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag1904", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——不知何时起，安洁也开始有些改变。", "text_idx": 324, "plain": "——不知何时起，安洁也开始有些改变。", "plain_idx": 324, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这个开朗的女孩，比以前更多了一份沉稳。", "text_idx": 325, "plain": "这个开朗的女孩，比以前更多了一份沉稳。", "plain_idx": 325, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
