{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你俩真恩爱啊～♪」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0346", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哇你吓死我了！」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉，还是说出来了……我本来都装作没看见的……」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": "「唉，还是说出来了……我本来都装作没看见的……」", "plain_idx": 353, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4044", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶、诶」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag1911", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱爱爱理同学，难不成我们很醒目吗？！」", "text_idx": 357, "plain": "「爱爱爱理同学，难不成我们很醒目吗？！」", "plain_idx": 357, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag1912", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可能是整个学校最醒目的吧」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0362", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只要大家都不说不就好了，真是的……」", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4045", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不不不，就是得吐槽才显得你们特别嘛」", "text_idx": 364, "plain": "「不不不，就是得吐槽才显得你们特别嘛」", "plain_idx": 364, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0347", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀、啊啊……」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag1913", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来我们的互动，似乎成了大家关注的焦点。", "text_idx": 368, "plain": "看来我们的互动，似乎成了大家关注的焦点。", "plain_idx": 368, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊？算了，反正都这个时候了……瓜生你都不留个心眼儿吗？」", "text_idx": 369, "plain": "「啊？算了，反正都这个时候了……瓜生你都不留个心眼儿吗？」", "plain_idx": 369, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4046", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊？呃……真不好意思…………」", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你可真是散漫呢，枉为瓜生新吾」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4047", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我无法反驳她的话。", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，我变成这样，也是因为眼里全是安洁。", "text_idx": 375, "plain": "不过，我变成这样，也是因为眼里全是安洁。", "plain_idx": 375, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘻……嘻嘻……」", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag1914", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「少爷也太不注意了，不过，这也是安洁的荣幸」", "text_idx": 378, "plain": "「少爷也太不注意了，不过，这也是安洁的荣幸」", "plain_idx": 378, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag1915", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「痛痛痛！别打了别打了！我可不是安洁你的荣幸」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": "「痛痛痛！别打了别打了！我可不是安洁你的荣幸」", "plain_idx": 380, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0363", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来安洁也乐在其中，那就好。", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想到这里，我也就不好说什么了。", "text_idx": 383, "plain": "想到这里，我也就不好说什么了。", "plain_idx": 383, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
